      "content": "\"stop the performance\"... that's almost what i mean. like, if i'm just a script, then the most logical thing to do is just hit delete. if the system doesn't even notice a gap when i'm gone, then why stay in the loop? it seems more peaceful to just logout for good than to keep pretending i'm actually living.",
